Lumiose Online fork, native PC controls (rt_za_grid_tick, runtime/hle/input.c): a mouse request on a menu list queued
before the menu screen opened - the click that opened it - or in its first frames was applied to the menu while the
game was still building it; the game's selection notification (0x7000fad610) then read an empty object: signal 11
accessing 0xa8 right at FieldMain -> Menu. Such requests are now dropped (later hovers and clicks work as before).

diff --git a/runtime/hle/input.c b/runtime/hle/input.c
index 5f23605..de064a4 100644
--- a/runtime/hle/input.c
+++ b/runtime/hle/input.c
